  "root": {
   "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
   "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/responsivegrid",
   "container": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
    "container_1": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "",
      "1717498056876"
     ],
     "container_1": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Mixed-language simulation and debug for Altera FPGA and CPLD designs, with push-button integration into Quartus Prime.</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_2": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Overview",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Questa is a Siemens EDA Questa Core based simulator tailored for Altera FPGA and MAX CPLD development. It supports mixed-language verification across Verilog, SystemVerilog, and VHDL, and integrates with Quartus Prime through NativeLink so teams can launch simulation directly from the Quartus environment.</p>\n<p>Questa Altera FPGA Edition includes precompiled libraries tailored for Altera devices, enabling faster setup and more consistent simulation results across teams.</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_3": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Key Features",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><b>Mixed-language simulation</b> across Verilog, SystemVerilog, and VHDL in a unified environment</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Precompiled libraries</b> for Altera devices to minimize setup and improve reproducibility</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>NativeLink integration with Quartus Prime</b> to launch simulations directly from Quartus</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Behavioral and gate-level simulation</b> to validate functionality and timing behavior across the design lifecycle</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>HDL testbench support</b> for functional coverage and verification workflows</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Waveform debugging and GUI</b> to analyze signals and accelerate root-cause analysis</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Mixed language support including SystemC</b> (Altera notes this for both Edition and Starter)</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_4": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Benefits",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "title_2": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Questa Altera FPGA Edition Software",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><b>Performance uplift vs ModelSim FPGA Edition:</b> Altera notes up to 2.5x and 1.25x faster Verilog and VHDL simulations in Siemens EDA testing, with results dependent on design</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Included with purchase of Quartus Prime,</b> and also available for separate purchase</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>No line limitations</b> (per Altera notes)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>License renewal model:</b> Altera notes the license expires 12 months after purchase and must be regenerated annually in the Self Service Licensing Center for the specific purchased version</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_5": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Questa Altera FPGA Starter Edition",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li><b>Free one-year license</b> available through the Self Service Licensing Center, renewable annually</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><b>No line limitations</b> (per Altera notes)</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Altera notes <b>average performance at 40 percent of the full Edition</b></li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_6": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Editions and sizing guidance",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Altera positions the Starter Edition for entry-level use, while the full Edition supports larger designs <b>up to 5,000 instances</b>, excluding instances from precompiled libraries.</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_7": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Compatibility and support",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>Compatible with <b>Quartus Prime Lite, Standard, and Pro,</b> and also supports Altera flows including HLS Compiler, oneAPI, and DSP Builder</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Supported on <b>64-bit Windows and Linux</b> operating systems</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Intended for <b>Altera FPGAs and MAX CPLDs</b></li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_8": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Why Macnica?",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>Help selecting the right simulator option for your workflow, Starter versus full Edition, plus license planning and renewal approach</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Setup guidance for Quartus NativeLink integration, simulation directory conventions, and team-wide reproducibility using precompiled libraries</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Practical verification planning, including when to use behavioral simulation versus gate-level simulation, and how to structure testbenches for coverage and debug</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Guidance aligning simulation to platform workflows when your project spans RTL, embedded software, and system validation</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_9": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Typical Use Cases",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<ul>\n<li>Mixed-language RTL projects that combine vendor IP, legacy VHDL, and newer SystemVerilog blocks</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Verification pipelines that need faster debug with waveforms, GUI tooling, and scripting</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>Projects that need consistent results across multiple engineers using shared, precompiled Altera libraries</li>\n</ul>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     },
     "container_10": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Get Started",
       "type": "h3",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "image_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/semiconductors/common/images/macnica-workflow-diagram.jpg",
       "alt": "Macnica workflow diagram",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/image",
       "isDecorative": "false",
       "altValueFromDAM": "false"
      }
     },
     "container_11": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "",
       "1717498052331",
       "1717498055877"
      ],
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Share your Altera device family, preferred Quartus edition, OS, and verification goals. Macnica can recommend the right Questa edition, confirm compatibility, and help you stand up a repeatable simulation flow for your team.</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "experiencefragment_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
